        "content":  "\u003cdiv data-wp-interactive=\"core/file\" class=\"wp-block-file\"\u003e\u003cobject data-wp-bind--hidden=\"!state.hasPdfPreview\" hidden class=\"wp-block-file__embed\" data=\"https://bejingmedya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Kurte-brosur-Jineoloji-kurdi-u-erebi.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\" style=\"width:100%;height:600px\" aria-label=\"Kurte broşür Jineolojî - kurdî û erebî gömüsü.\"\u003e\u003c/object\u003e\u003ca id=\"wp-block-file--media-93f7a457-bbf0-429e-9765-11650e46ea81\" href=\"https://bejingmedya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Kurte-brosur-Jineoloji-kurdi-u-erebi.pdf\"\u003eKurte broşür Jineolojî \u0026#8211; kurdî û erebî\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://bejingmedya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Kurte-brosur-Jineoloji-kurdi-u-erebi.pdf\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" aria-describedby=\"wp-block-file--media-93f7a457-bbf0-429e-9765-11650e46ea81\" download\u003eİndir\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
