        "featured_image":  "assets/media/articles/tr_3101_featured_image.png",
        "excerpt":  "Rana Mullan",
        "content":  "\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRana Mullan\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv data-wp-interactive=\"core/file\" class=\"wp-block-file\"\u003e\u003cobject data-wp-bind--hidden=\"!state.hasPdfPreview\" hidden class=\"wp-block-file__embed\" data=\"https://bejingmedya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cedaw-1.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\" style=\"width:100%;height:600px\" aria-label=\"cedaw gömüsü.\"\u003e\u003c/object\u003e\u003ca id=\"wp-block-file--media-4d9953f7-e7c6-4faf-b96a-57eecc1bd52f\" href=\"https://bejingmedya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cedaw-1.pdf\"\u003ecedaw\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://bejingmedya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cedaw-1.pdf\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" aria-describedby=\"wp-block-file--media-4d9953f7-e7c6-4faf-b96a-57eecc1bd52f\" download\u003eİndir\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
